OL,3,GNEWSAFewer than 800 Scots have received
OL,4,Aweight loss jabs on NHS, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FFewer than 800 Scots have received jabs
OL,7,Ffor weight loss on the NHS despite them
OL,8,Fbeing approved for use three years ago,
OL,9,FBBC News has found.
OL,11,FWhile private prescriptions for Wegovey
OL,12,Fand Mounjaro have soared, fewer than
OL,13,Fhalf of Scotland's health boards
OL,14,Fcurrently offer the treatment
OL,15,Fspecifically for weight loss - and then
OL,16,Fonly as part of small pilot schemes.
OL,18,FLeading doctors have described the
OL,19,Fsituation as "discriminatory" and
OL,20,Fargued that the lack of access on the
OL,21,FNHS is widening health inequalities.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
