OL,3,GNEWSAFewer than 800 Scots have received
OL,4,Aweight loss jabs on NHS, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said the
OL,7,Fmedicines were part of a range of
OL,8,Ftreatments for obesity, and that
OL,9,Findividual health boards were
OL,10,Fresponsible for decisions on the
OL,11,Favailability of medicines.
